        (FUpdate 1 7 (FUpdate 1 8 (FConstant 0))) 2`` ``0 : num`` andalso
  closed_eval_is ``eval_cfun (CConstant 9) T`` ``9 : num``))
  (fn () => "narrowing function evaluator did not EVAL")
  (fn () => ()) ()

